  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impactnr. - 220000043 - IOM NL Return and Emigration Assistance from the Netherlands (REAN) 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impactnr. - 220000043 -  The objective of the &#x201C;Return and Emigration Assistance from the Netherlands 2022-2024&#x201D; programme (hereinafter referred to as REAN Programme) is to contribute to the humane and orderly management of migration in the Netherlands through the provision of Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration (AVRR) services to migrants departing from the Netherlands in accordance with IOM&#x2019;s Constitution and policies. Through the REAN Programme IOM shall assist migrants in the Netherlands with their voluntary return to the country of origin, or with their resettlement to a third country where their admission is guaranteed.</narrative>
  </description>
